## two rays: the weaker instrument alone
let card = import("data/card.csv")
card.ivreg(lwage ~ exper + expersq + black + south + smsa + educ, instruments: educ ~ nearc2).ar_test()

---
ar_test · lwage ~ exper + expersq + black + south + smsa + educ · educ
  H0: the coefficient of educ is zero          β = 0
  H1: the coefficient of educ is not zero      β ≠ 0
F(1, 3,003) = 8.11   p = 0.004
decision at α = 0.05: reject H0 (p = 0.004)
95% confidence set for the coefficient of educ: every value up to -1.4606 and every value from 0.1189 on; the instruments are too weak to bound it on both sides
