## two instrumented regressors: the joint test, no set
let card = import("data/card.csv")
card.ivreg(lwage ~ black + south + smsa + educ + KWW, instruments: educ + KWW ~ nearc4 + nearc2 + fatheduc + motheduc).ar_test()

---
ar_test · lwage ~ black + south + smsa + educ + KWW · educ and KWW
  H0: the coefficients of educ and KWW are all zero
  H1: at least one of the coefficients of educ and KWW is not zero
F(4, 2,183) = 8.29   p < 0.001
decision at α = 0.05: reject H0 (p < 0.001)
no confidence set: with several instrumented regressors the test is of all their coefficients at once
Anderson–Rubin test on the instruments nearc4, nearc2, fatheduc, motheduc; valid however weak the instruments
